    "description": "King's guard quarters, level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 461 blocks vs 350 (first build 415 vs 290). Compact stone barracks house for 8 guards (the brief's 7 x 9): mess room with long table, hearth and weapon rack below, 8 beds in two rows under the roof by a stair, a guard post under the jettied plaster gable; L2 banners, lanterns, shutters; L3 a drill corner with a straw dummy and target. Not yet builder-tested: brick_stairs, carved_pumpkin, red_wall_banner, stone_brick_wall, target, vine. Decoration step adds: armor_stand, banner_pattern, item_frame.",
